    "body": "Problem:\r\nHandlers defer `show()` on unloaded buffers with a buffer-local BufRead\r\nautocmd whose id is stored per-namespace:\r\n- `noautocmd bwipeout` deletes the autocmd, so the next show/hide fails.\r\n- Showing another buffer in the same namespace cancels the pending show.\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nHandlers skip unloaded buffers. The existing global BufRead autocmd\r\nshows cached diagnostics when the buffer loads.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n- partial #39792 : removes the per-buffer `BufRead` autocmds. The per-buffer `BufWipeout` cleanup autocmds in `_store.lua` are still present.\r\n- close #42207\r\n- close #42094\r\n- close #42265\r\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-12T09:44:46Z",
